cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "nifty-vol-forecast: Realized volatility forecasting on NIFTY-50 with GARCH, HAR-RV, and deep sequence models"
abstract: >
  An open-source benchmark of classical and modern approaches to one-step-ahead
  realized volatility forecasting on Indian equity index data. Implements
  GARCH(1,1), EGARCH, HAR-RV (Corsi 2009), XGBoost, LSTM, and Transformer
  models under strict walk-forward cross-validation, evaluated with QLIKE
  loss and Diebold-Mariano tests of pairwise predictive accuracy.
